flowchart TB
  A[Post that you take commissions] --> B[Wait for clients to apply in messages]
  B --> C[Review applications]
  C --> D[Accept one client]
  D --> E[Wait for payment]
  E --> F{Paid?}
  F -->|Not yet; they withdrew| E
  F -->|Yes| G[Produce the work]
  G --> H[Send progress files if needed]
  H --> I[Submit for client approval]
  I --> J{Client satisfied?}
  J -->|Changes requested| G
  J -->|Approved| K[Close the job]
